omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eOH-Ayf2kUAQ7kNvwGsNiP_&_nc_oc=AdpPDHflH9U8pm62bOJDkPwVK3spilkah8J1g_8-x7zEUx4Fh-J6hpRUQEpkljUCVGo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1ApvHfzskwDtlr0P_-7lvDKrxgPFIx8N6TijHV07Qs8w&oe=69EB8AB4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EUJChHC2slYQ7kNvwFds5nQ&_nc_oc=AdqneTvz4CSbnZvH2J-IvKouG9wTqDh-bG4c2IOOwXVgXrETQQUEg2egMqCQh8sxYDM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af31RiVy0xiaGYvi96fFT-E3fVOSR-8KxMngdCCL697fBg&oe=69EB8C16"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KkBf43gBhxcQ7kNvwECjnZo&_nc_oc=AdqplV2y9nt_gwPeRxyYmgpD2-JmIHHb2tPOu_QKr2bI4JsPqbMYzW80dBeDXV4pCLM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0oi4Pii6BuI73Z5VyHQeH8aUIr-JgYK8e4wR0B21bX5Q&oe=69EB68F7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://